      <div class="mp18 fx-rise shop-m-15" data-fx="reveal" >$24.99</div>
      <p class="ma mb15 fx-rise shop-m-16" data-fx="reveal" >Speaking to flavor notes, lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, dolor sit. Pellentesque sit amet sapien fringilla, mattis ligula consectetur.</p>

      <div class="ma mmono fx-rise shop-m-17" data-fx="reveal" >Select Flavor:</div>
      <button type="button" class="mftile fx-rise shop-m-18" data-fx="reveal" data-mpick="cherry"  aria-label="Cherry Limeade"><img class="shop-m-19" src="{{ 'm_s_tile_cl.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy" ></button>
      <button type="button" class="mftile fx-rise shop-m-20" data-fx="reveal" data-mpick="pine"  aria-label="Pineapple Mango"><img class="shop-m-21" src="{{ 'm_s_tile_pm_can.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy" ></button>
